{"resourceIdentifier":"2322","resourceName":"Monet Forest Conservation Project","description":"In 2007, Solifor Bloc Monet S.E.C made the acquisition of a vast forest property designated as the Monet forest block, located in the province of Quebec, Canada. Although the main purposes of this acquisition was oriented towards logging activities, Solifor Bloc Monet S.E.C has suspended the annual harvesting operations since 2016 to analyze the opportunity of creating a conservation easement to fix more carbon in the forest pool.\r\n \r\nThe current project is a VCS Improved Forest Management (IMF) – Logged to Protected Forest (LtPF) conservation project aiming at preserving intact the whole forest property by preventing logging on a productive forest area of 10,614 ha (26,228 acres). The project longevity is set at 60 years. \r\nSince 2016, the conservation project scenario has generated GHG emission reductions by allowing the biomass of standing trees to fix more CO2 than the baseline scenario. With the baseline scenario, carbon is emitted in the short term following tree removal, by decomposition of logging slash and combustion of bark, and in the long term by gradual release of the carbon fraction sequestered in the harvested wood products over time. \r\n\r\nThe most plausible baseline scenario is an annual sustainable harvest level of 12,900 m3 of merchantable volume of softwood and hardwood, as modelled in the annual allowable cut (ACC) calculation. By preventing this annual harvest, the project scenario carries net cumulative GHG emission reductions of 72 885 tCO2e over the first 10 years with buffer deduction, 151 038 tCO2e over the first 20 years with buffer deduction, and 287 018 tCO2e over 60 years with buffer deduction, compared to the baseline scenario.","location":{"latitude":48.155813,"longitude":-75.661097},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-11-12","endExclusive":"2020-12-13","endInclusive":"2020-12-12"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2322"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"QC"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Solifor Bloc Monet S.E.C."},{"type":"string","value":"QC, Canada"},{"type":"string","value":"418-837-0100"},{"type":"string","value":"foresterie@solifor.ca"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2322"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2322"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"7552"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":4154}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"IFM"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0012"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10614 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"03/09/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/05/2016 - 30/04/2036"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49413&IDKEY=dq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh068140527","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Draft_project_description.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-11-10T23:26:50.05Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49066&IDKEY=n903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf067662014","documentType":"L